error[SC0104]: this line marker is not read
   ╭─[ a_line_marker_name_with_a_ctrl_z_escape_is_refused.c:1:1 ]
   │
 1 │ # 1 "a\x1ab"
   │ ┬  
   │ ╰── directive begins here
───╯
  = note: `"a\x1ab"` is not a string literal with no prefix whose escapes make UTF-8 text
  = note: a line marker is read as a line from 0 to 4294967295 in decimal digits, a string literal with no prefix if it names the file, and after that `1` or `2`, then `3`, then `4` after a `3`
